      Entry: 7
      Data: 12|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Normally zero. Any yaw tilts a member off the shoal's heading, and its
        sideways drift then has a component pointing out of its own tail - the same
        reverse-swimming artefact the fore/aft term causes, just smaller. Members
        keeping the shoal's exact heading makes the sideways drift perfectly perpendicular,
        so it can never read as backwards.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
