    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 16|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Fore/aft component, normally zero. Members keep the shoal''s heading,
        so any motion along their own length spends half its cycle travelling tail-first
        - measurably so: at 0.15 the shoal logged 1.44 m of reverse travel in under
        eight seconds. Sideways and vertical drift loosens the formation without
        ever backing a fish up.'
    - Name: 
